{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_016490","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"在CO-OPS中，与同伴保持紧密沟通非常重要。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"当然。战场上一旦失去联络，往往就会直接导致部队覆灭。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"敌人的位置、各种指示、救援请求。要是不互相保持联络，就会被各个击破。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"所以才有CO-OPS通信。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":"AUX_MEANING_DRIFT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"CO-OPS通信……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"这是CO-OPS同伴之间互相联络用的无线电。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"首先打开菜单窗口，选择『CO-OPS通信』。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"然后，第一次按下的按钮用来选择类别，第二次按下的按钮用来选择具体语句。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"也就是说，用两个按钮的组合来决定要说什么。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":"AUX_TRUNCATED_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"哦。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":"AUX_MEANING_DRIFT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"每个按钮分配什么语句，可以在出击准备时设置。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"还没习惯的时候，看来光是发送无线电就会花不少时间。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"这种时候，可以试着把CO-OPS通信分配到自己顺手的按钮上。这样应该能省掉发送时的麻烦。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":120,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"在『KEY CONFIG』里设置就行。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":37,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"试试看吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""}]}